State and justify the running time, as a function of n, of this method:

int count(int n) {
    int count = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        for (int j = 1; j < n; j *= 2) {
            count++;
        }
    }
    return count;
}

Write your answer as a short explanation. You may also write code if it helps.
